{"records":[{"timestamp_text":"2026-01-10 09:00 UTC","participants":["TX-1","ACC-100","ACC-200"],"summary":"A detailed transaction export records TX-1 as settled for USD 500 from source account ACC-100 to destination account ACC-200. It includes an internal processing reference but does not identify a beneficiary person, beneficiary organization, or controller for ACC-200.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-002","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1-detail"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["service provider"],"summary":"An evidence-request note states that login and authentication audit records for the transaction window were not included in the case packet. It requests those records from the service provider, but no provider response is attached, leaving the transaction-session authentication record unresolved.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-auth-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/evidence-request/login-audit"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["D-17","Alice Chen","ACC-100"],"summary":"The device inventory lists device D-17 as observed in the same administrative account context as ACC-100. It does not establish that Alice Chen operated D-17 during TX-1 and contains no authenticated session identifier linking the device to the transaction.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-device-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/device-inventory/device-D17"}]}]}